# Switch RomFS staging directory
#
# At build time, the Switch CMake target populates this tree from the host
# build machine's game payload and then packs it into the NRO via elf2nro's
# `--romfsdir` argument. At runtime, libnx's `romfsInit()` mounts the packed
# archive at `romfs:/` and `EmbeddedAssets::GetGameRoot()` (see
# LibertyRecomp/install/embedded_assets.cpp) resolves to `romfs:/game`.
#
# Expected layout (produced by the build — do NOT commit the real payload):
#
#   romfs/
#   ├── game/          ← copied from ${LIBERTY_RECOMP_EMBEDDED_GAME_PATH}
#   │   ├── default.xex
#   │   ├── common.rpf
#   │   ├── xbox360.rpf
#   │   ├── audio.rpf
#   │   └── …
#   ├── dlc/           ← copied from ${LIBERTY_RECOMP_EMBEDDED_DLC_PATH} if set,
#   │   │                or from ${LIBERTY_RECOMP_EMBEDDED_GAME_PATH}/dlc
#   │   ├── TLAD/
#   │   └── TBOGT/
#   ├── aes_key.bin    ← XEX decryption key, copied from
#   │                    ${LIBERTY_RECOMP_EMBEDDED_AES_KEY} if set
#   └── manifest.json  ← generated by configure_file() in the top-level CMake
#
# Only .gitkeep files are tracked in git — the real game assets are sourced
# per-build from the host file system and must NEVER be committed.
